Source: larch-static
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Larch Networks <dev@larch-networks.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>=9), device-tree-compiler
Standards-Version: 3.9.6

Package: larch-static
Architecture: arm64
Description: Device tree blobs for the Larch Networks boards
 The blobs are compiled from the sources in boot/dts and installed in /boot,
 where platform_arm64.conf and sonic_fit.its pick them up.
